   176	50540641,Timon3,119,False,Loopholes Are for Assholes,Litmus test for a person’s moral character: do you return your shopping cart to the corral?<p>Caveat that this is for stores that don’t incentivize with getting your coin returned.,"After only ever seeing carts with coins in Germany, over the last years I&#x27;ve been to a bunch of supermarkets without coins. AFAICS all the carts are still being returned, and they don&#x27;t seem to have GPS-driven brakes, so cart theft rates can&#x27;t be too bad.<p>I&#x27;d say that&#x27;s a positive sign!",0
